From f0bfa766c330729c4311d45ad6e16fc03ef5b5fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lucas Santos <lsantos7654@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 7 May 2026 23:28:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03/36] SDK gen: ephemeral on Session + create/fork inputs

Regenerated bindings for the ephemeral session column. The new
field appears on the Session response type, on Session.create's
flat parameters, and on Session2's create body. No client-side
behavior change beyond the typed surface.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
